DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special celebration honoring the Feast Day of Our
  Lady of Guadalupe on December 11 at the Cathedral of St. John the Evangel
 ist in Lafayette. The evening will begin with a bilingual recitation of th
 e Rosary at 5:30 PM in the Cathedral Carmel School Yard Pavilion\, followe
 d by a procession outside the Cathedral at 6:00 PM. A bilingual Mass will 
 take place inside the Cathedral at 6:30 PM\, concluding with a reception a
 t 7:30 PM. The Diocese of Lafayette's Office of Hispanic Ministry proudly 
 sponsors this public event. All are welcome!\n\nhttps://happeningnext.com/
